.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::PoreVolumeRHS< dim >"Accumulates the pore-volume - advected variable product into the right-hand vector as divided by the time increment\&. 

This method will always be the first ADD_ACCUMULATE task for the righthandside\&.

